sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant P1 as User
    participant P2 as Web/Gateway
    participant P3 as Payments API
    participant P4 as Provider adapter
    participant P5 as Provider hosted checkout
    participant P6 as Database/outbox
    P1->>P2: Request checkout
    P2->>P3: Validate order state
    P3->>P4: Create provider session
    P4->>P5: Persist provider refs
    P5->>P6: Return checkout URL
    P6-->>P1: Résultat / statut vérifié
